  "_screens": "`screens`: each opened by its launch arguments alone (ark_app::shell::Launch, the reference's names: .github/screens/apps.md), on the Apple devices it is `on` (ios, ipad-portrait, ipad-landscape, mac); its id is the reference app's shot's (reference/universal-budget/ci/shots.sh on the design-ref branch), so the two pair. `launch.mac` is the Mac's own arguments before each: the demo's household (no browser signs the Mac in) at 1440x900.",
